   "source": [
    "## Compare embedded carbon anticipation function to original CBM model\n",
    "\n",
    "The new `ws3` embedded carbon anticipation function is a simplified version of the original CBM model, so we expect it will produce highly correlated but somewhat offset results from the original `libcbm` model.\n",
    "\n",
    "We can verify this by comparing carbon output from both models side-by-side.\n",
    "\n",
    "We start by defining a utility function that runs `libcbm`, compiles `libcbm` and `ws3` carbon pool and flux data into analogous tables, and plots results."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
